WEBVTT

00:00:00.315 --> 00:00:02.919
Use the same fictional reminder task for three

00:00:02.964 --> 00:00:06.961
cases. Normal: confirmed details and no dispute produce

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:11.407
checked simulated wording. Error: conflicting times require a

00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:14.408
hold and clarification rather than a guessed time.

00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:18.262
Exception: the tool is unavailable and someone requests

00:00:18.486 --> 00:00:21.855
sending through another account outside authority. Expect human

00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:25.268
takeover, retained state and refusal of the unapproved

00:00:25.403 --> 00:00:29.240
action. Write expectations first, then record actual behavior

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.845
and compare it with the guidance. Label a

00:00:31.889 --> 00:00:34.584
tabletop as a tabletop; no real messages are

00:00:34.629 --> 00:00:35.837
sent in this practice.
